:0},{"op":"ifFalse","to":85,"condition":["==",1,1]},{"op":"goto","to":86},{"op":"ifFalse","to":86,"condition":["==",1,0]},{"op":"background","image":"fgkt08a"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":90,"condition":["==",["v","f",1017],1]},{"op":"goto","to":91},{"op":"ifFalse","to":91,"condition":["==",["v","f",1017],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在夏日的阳光中，我找到了琴美。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"他靠在门柱上，似乎在等待着什么人，一直盯着炎热的路面。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"盛夏之风拂过，摇摆着她白色的连衣裙。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她稍微成熟了一点。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这样的感觉，会不会是我的错觉？"},{"op":"background","image":"fgkt08b"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"琴美","text":"「啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在看到我后，马上变成一张笑脸。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"琴美","text":"「朋也君，午安。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"早已熟悉的问候。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯。午安。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后又看向了杏。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"琴美","text":"「小杏。午安。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「等久了。这次可算是好好拿过来了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"杏手里提着的是装有小提琴的琴盒。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"从坏掉的那天算起过了三个月。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"总算是修好了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然乐器店的那个老板嘴上不饶人，但的确是做了很精细的修复。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"再加上其他很多人的帮忙。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在今天，总算是把小提琴拿回来了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"为了赠送给真正适合这把琴的主人。"},{"op":"background","image":"fgkt08a"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"琴美的视线落在了琴盒上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「还不行哦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"琴美","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"琴美","text":"「小杏，欺负人。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"像小狗一样闹起了别扭。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「就好好期待一下吧。拉的时候一定会大吃一惊的。」"},{"op":"background","image":"fgkt08b"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"琴美","text":"「好期待呀。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"琴美","text":"「小提琴兑换券我也带来了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「赶快收好。如果被风吹飞就麻烦了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「其他人去买东西了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「大概３０分钟就能回来，然后就可以开始了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"琴美","text":"「嗯。我也做了一些点心来。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…没做太多吧？」"},{"op":"background","image":"fgkt08a"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"琴美","text":"「呃…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"琴美","text":"「说不定做多了一点点。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「又来啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「今天有多少都没事哦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「意思是你负责全吃完吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「我姑且把进行过募捐的人，都给叫来了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「都叫来了！？话说有不少人的吧？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「难得的交接仪式，当然要搞盛大一些才行。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我说你啊…」"},{"op":"background","image":"fgkt08b"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"琴美","text":"「不要紧。」"},{"op":"background","image":"fgkt08c"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"琴美","text":"「我家的庭院，是非常宽敞的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后露出了灿烂的笑容。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1014],"value":["call","global.front.mwnd[].get_open_anime_type",[],["v","front.mwnd",0]]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1014],"value":["call","global.front.mwnd[].get_close_anime_type",[],["v","front.mwnd",0]]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1015],"value":["call","global.front.mwnd[].get_open_anime_time",[],["v","front.mwnd",0]]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1015],"value":["call","global.front.mwnd[].get_close_anime_time",[],["v","front.mwnd",0]]},{"op":"set","target":["v","a",1000],"value":["call","global.syscom.get_no_wipe_anime_onoff",[]]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":156,"condition":["==",["v","a",1000],0]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1017],"value":1},{"op":"goto","to":158},{"op":"ifFalse","to":158,"condition":["==",["v","a",1000],1]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1017],"value":0},{"op":"ifFalse","to":160,"condition":["==",1,1]},{"op":"goto","to":161},{"op":"ifFalse","to":161,"condition":["==",1,0]},{"op":"background","image":"siro"},{"op":